{"text":"have meaningfully put a dent in poverty in our time. And yet, at the same time, we know that there is not a single country on Earth that has relied on aid to the extent that African countries rely on aid today that has reduced poverty and created long-term growth. And I'll come back to this point later, but let's remember these facts. I'd like to start off by saying that it's very easy for people to categorize, and I know this Westerners love this. They like to say, oh, no, she's black, or he's white, and he's Republican, or she's Democrat, or he's pro-aid, or she's against aid. And I think that that actually detracts from a lot of the things that we know to be true and where we have a lot of common goals. So I think there are three things in particular where we all agree. And the first thing that we all agree on is that Africa should not rely on aid forever. I think we all look forward to a day where Africa can be an equal partner on the global stage and not rely on aid to the extent that the continent does today. And by the way, I always give people an option. If people feel like they want to see Africa remain in poverty and remain aid-dependent, you're welcome to put your hands up and we can have that discussion. But I think we all agree that...","words":[{"text":"have","start":0.0,"end":0.36},{"text":"meaningfully","start":0.36,"end":1.04},{"text":"put","start":1.04,"end":1.18},{"text":"a","start":1.18,"end":1.32},{"text":"dent","start":1.32,"end":1.5},{"text":"in","start":1.5,"end":1.72},{"text":"poverty","start":1.72,"end":2.04},{"text":"in","start":2.04,"end":2.52},{"text":"our","start":2.52,"end":2.66},{"text":"time","start":2.66,"end":3.0,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":3.62,"end":3.64},{"text":"yet","start":3.64,"end":3.94,"punct":","},{"text":"at","start":4.34,"end":4.72},{"text":"the","start":4.72,"end":4.88},{"text":"same","start":4.88,"end":5.08},{"text":"time","start":5.08,"end":5.34,"punct":","},{"text":"we","start":5.42,"end":5.5},{"text